Inter-CPU Microbenchmarks will be run with the following:
# Processes per NUMA: 64
# Processes per socket: 64
# Processes per node: 256
# of nodes: 2
If these are incorrect, edit the defines at the top of benchmarks/microbenchmarks.cpp
intra-socket tests will not be run because there is only one NUMA per socket.  The timings will be gathered in inter-NUMA tests.


